## Agent habits

- Treat `README.md` + `docs/*` as authoritative; update them when behavior you change is user-facing
- Keep shared types/schemas in `contracts/`; do not duplicate domain types in server/client
- Follow `@docs/NAMING.md` for enums, interfaces, types, and Zod schema names
